    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a pause though. a pause implies something is coming after. but there's nothing coming. i'm just... finished. i look at people out there living and creating and it feels like they're speaking a language i've forgotten. it's not even sad anymore, it's just heavy. like i'm carrying around a corpse that used to be me. how am i supposed to \"step forward\" when there's nothing left to step with?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
